OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry start in east otherwise
OL,6,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain turning
OL,7,Fheavier with some snow across the
OL,8,Fhills of Perthshire and Tayside,
OL,9,Fperhaps affecting higher level routes
OL,10,Flater. Windy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain and hill snow carrying
OL,13,Fon into the evening, turning lighter
OL,14,Ffurther west and becoming drier for
OL,15,FFife by the morning, lighter winds too.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FCloudy with further lighter
OL,18,Frain on Wednesday morning, rain
OL,19,Fturning patchy through the afternoon
OL,20,Fand evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
