OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith a few bright spells on Thursday
OL,7,Fbut winds strengthening. Further rain
OL,8,Fon Friday, wintry again over the
OL,9,Fhills. Turning brighter but cold again
OL,10,Flater on Friday and Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
